WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.300
Sharanga, the legendary bow of Lord Ram,

2
00:03.400 --> 00:06.940
shoots arrows that seek out enemies on their own,

3
00:07.100 --> 00:09.900
so nothing can hide in its wake.

4
00:11.060 --> 00:15.500
Vijaya, the weapon of the divine
weaponsmith Vishwakarma,

5
00:15.800 --> 00:18.300
shoots multiple arrows in an arc,

6
00:18.700 --> 00:22.700
obliterating anything and everything in its path.

7
00:23.800 --> 00:26.380
Once hailed as the harbinger of the end,

8
00:26.450 --> 00:29.640
Pinaka, bow of Lord Shiv,

9
00:29.700 --> 00:33.140
can drown enemies in a hail of arrows

10
00:33.140 --> 00:35.100
in just a matter of seconds.

11
00:36.500 --> 00:38.700
The Indra shoots heavy arrows,

12
00:38.750 --> 00:40.400
but its true strength…
